  "device_note": "All scored numbers are from box 5 (Vast 53255833, RTX 4060 Ti, cuda, fp32, flock /tmp/wm_gpu.lock): native context-only pass (730 clips: 490 probe + 240 knot, 77 s) and all 64 forward groups (128 carriers, 166 GPU s), run 17:37-17:42 ET from artifacts/time_predictor_gpu. A CPU run of the same forward on box 1 (/dev/shm/wm_time2) was started first; none of its group files are used (no CPU/GPU mixing). Its box-1 CPU native pass was stopped at 17:37 when the GPU box became available.",
